[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Two nights have passed, and still my light has not gone out.
"Dianthus Core": The shadows learned the shape of this garden. You taught them it has thorns.
"Dianthus Core": Keep the Aether Bloom close. Rare life answers rare courage, and we will need both before the dark names itself.
"Dianthus Core": The next omen will not whisper from far away. It will come with teeth.
